  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Hard boundary",
      "items": [
        "Server is a generic audio API — it does not know the robot exists",
        "Robot is a generic audio client — it does not know STT/LLM/TTS exist",
        "Only the audio contract is shared: WAV · 16kHz · mono · int16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Cognitive path",
      "items": [
        "The controller returns an immutable plan first: a memory question is answered from what memory found, never invented",
        "The LLM (Ollama only, one transport) chats only on generic turns: it sees the session and the profile card, never a household store",
        "A generic speaker is named by face or a token; a memory offer, answer or security read also needs the same person's verified voice",
        "One canonical writer for every channel; a secret is kept by reference, never its value; the alta loads it and iroko-admin amends it, audited",
        "Profile card: the name always, the tastes only on taste talk, the form through the language rule (Plans 0074, 0081)",
        "Recall, relatives and sensitive reads answer by template or found text only, behind their switches; the record keeps markers (Plans 0077 to 0080)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Known gaps",
      "items": [
        "No liveness or replay defense, accepted for the home (ADR 0029)",
        "No correcting or forgetting by voice (CM-6), no spoken third-party capture, no answering in company",
        "A PIN grant proves the PIN, not the speaker (ADR-0015); the 3B model's own answers are a limit (P4.1)"
      ]
    }
  ]
